    "result_text": "Done. The full suite is green.\n\n## What I changed\n\nThe `initials` field flows through the OpenAPI-generated `OwnerDto`, so two edits were needed:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (alongside the existing `displayName`), which regenerates `OwnerDto` with an `initials` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes it:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"initials\",\n       expression = \"java(Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\" + Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\")\")\n   ```\n\nFor `firstName=\"john\"`, `lastName=\"smith\"` this yields `\"J.S.\"`, matching the spec and the new acceptance test. `BUILD SUCCESS`, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
